  "phoneBrandGuideCaveat": "Menus vary by system version, region and model. These are common routes; use the Settings search if an item is missing. Returning to the app checks its actual status again.",
  "phoneBrandGuideHuaweiCaveat": "This APK requires a Huawei system that directly runs Android apps. Native HarmonyOS 5 / NEXT systems do not use these Android permission routes; a compatibility environment does not establish native support.",
